  "notes": "{焚|た}く means to burn or kindle something intentionally, such as fires, incense, or leaves.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle: ⟦{火|ひ}→火：02248_hi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{焚|た}く\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{焚|た}き{火|び}→焚き火：06992_takibi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{焚|た}く: to build a bonfire\n- ⟦お{香|こう}→香：17307_kou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{焚|た}く: to burn incense\n- ⟦{落|お}ち{葉|ば}→落ち葉：14108_ochiba⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{焚|た}く: to burn fallen leaves\n- ⟦{薪|まき}→薪：14118_maki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{焚|た}く: to burn firewood\n\nDISTINCTION FROM ⟦{炊|た}く→炊く：02127_taku⟧:\n- {焚|た}く: to burn (fire, incense) - uses {焚|た} kanji\n- ⟦{炊|た}く→炊く：02127_taku⟧: to cook rice - uses {炊|た} kanji\n\nBoth are pronounced たく but have different meanings and kanji.",
